    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nLocated in one of Trim's most prestigious and sought-after locations, Newtown Cottage enjoys a wonderful setting surrounded by some of the town's most recognisable historic landmarks. The Priory of St John the Baptist, St Peter and Paul's Cathedral and the 15th-century St Peter's Bridge, with its distinctive five arches, are all close by.\nJust steps away is a much-loved local pub and coffee dock, while the scenic Boyne River walk through the Porchfields is within strolling distance. Knightsbrook Hotel, Spa and Golf Club is also within a ten-minute walk, offering leisure, dining and events close at hand. Trim town centre, with its excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and everyday amenities, is also within easy reach.\nNewtown Cottage is a spacious four-bedroom residence extending to approximately 140 sq.m. (1,507 sq.ft.). While in need of refurbishment and modernisation throughout, the property offers generous proportions and considerable potential for a purchaser to create a home to their own taste and specification.\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance porch, two well-proportioned reception rooms, kitchen and a particularly spacious boiler/utility room on the ground floor. Upstairs there are four bedrooms together with a WC/shower room.\nWith its generous accommodation, refurbishment potential and exceptional location close to the heart of historic Trim, Newtown Cottage represents a rare opportunity to create a very special home.\nViewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nFront Porch - \nHardwood front door, vinyl flooring.\n\nFront Entrance hall - \nVinyl flooring, wall-mounted coat hangers.\n\nSitting Room - \nCarpeted floor. Fireplace with open fire and tiled surround.\n\nLiving Room - \nCarpeted floor. Alarm keypad.\n\nKitchen - \nVinyl flooring, MDF wrapped kitchen units with laminate worktops with tiled splashback and fan over. Creda electric hob/cooker, Solid fuel range.\n\nRear Entrance hall - \nVinyl floor. Connecting door to storage / boiler house.\n\nBoiler House / Storage Room - \nNordmende fridge/freezer unit. Hoover 9kg washing machine, Zanussi 6kg dryer, timber shelving around room. Exposed stone walls.\n\nStairs/Landing - \nCarpeted Stairs with wooden bannister, Carpeted landing, double glazed window with pvc frame.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nCarpeted floor, attic access. Built in storage presses and wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nCarpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nCarpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 4 / Office - \nCarpeted floor.\n\nShower room - \nwc, whb, shower.\n\n"
      },
